{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 82,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "God presides in the great assembly. He judges among the gods.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神站在有权力者的会中，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝站在有權力者的會中，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "“How long will you judge unjustly, and show partiality to the wicked?” Selah.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "说：你们审判不秉公义，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "說：你們審判不秉公義，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "“Defend the weak, the poor, and the fatherless. the rights of the poor and oppressed.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们当为贫寒的人和孤儿伸冤；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們當為貧寒的人和孤兒伸冤；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "Rescue the weak and needy. Deliver them out of the hand of the wicked.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "当保护贫寒和穷乏的人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "當保護貧寒和窮乏的人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "They don’t know, neither do they understand. They walk back and forth in darkness. All the foundations of the earth are shaken.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "你们仍不知道，也不明白，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "你們仍不知道，也不明白，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "I said, “You are gods, all of you are sons of the Most High.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我曾说：你们是神，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我曾說：你們是神，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Nevertheless you shall die like men, and fall like one of the rulers.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "然而，你们要死，与世人一样，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "然而，你們要死，與世人一樣，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "Arise, God, judge the earth, for you inherit all of the nations.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神啊，求你起来审判世界，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝啊，求你起來審判世界，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}